<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Asia Equity rates IFCT buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Asia Equity rates IFCT buy.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Industrial Finance Corporation of Thailand Plc remains a &quot;buy&quot; despite a downward revision of net profit forecasts for the next three years, said research house Asia Equity of Thailand.</p>
<p>A reduction in the bank's future funding costs would offset the effects of a revenue slowdown, it said in a report.</p>
<p>&quot;Projected revenues have been reduced by cuts in loan growth in 1997 and beyond and cuts in projected fee income. These are more than compensated by lower projected operating expenses,&quot; it added.</p>
</text>
